Policy
------
A verbatim port of any GPL-3.0 file would live under
quickshell/dots/vendor/ii/ with a GPL-3.0 header, the upstream copyright, a
"changed by" note and a line here, and it would make the combined shell
GPL-3.0. That needs an explicit decision; tests/shell.sh fails if vendor/
appears without those headers.

No fonts are bundled. JetBrains Mono Nerd Font and Material Symbols come from
nixpkgs.
